{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33342","headline":"诏放云南子弟还国 · 郑洪业","name":"诏放云南子弟还国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"德被陪臣子，仁垂圣主恩。\n雕题辞凤阙，丹服出金门。\n有泽沾殊俗，无征及犷𤟤\n铜梁分汉土，玉垒驾鸾轩。\n瘴岭蚕丛盛，巴江越嶲垠。\n万方同感化，岂独自南蕃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑洪业","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}